        rdfs:comment                   "Six loosely spaced horizontal rows of various stylized and naturalistic floral motives, individual flowers, vines, and in the lower rows, cottages and funery monuments. Polychrome floss silk yarns, mainly in satin stitch, on a white silk ground. Added border of blue and white linentape.  Stitches: French knots, satin, stem."@en ;
